# data/ is bulk and stays out, with one deliberate exception. codes.json is not bulk: it
# is a 228 KB derived index of every train code ever observed, built by a harvest that
# cannot be repeated for the past, and both backfill.py and validate_join.py read it.
# Until 2026-08-31 it existed only on one laptop. Versioning it also timestamps when the
# set changed, so a figure computed against an earlier set stays attributable.
